{"version":1,"content":"<p>樊亦敏及歐瑞偉將於下周一（26日）播出的無綫處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》「龔喜駕到」一集中登場。</p><p>劇組今日（23日）率先公開2人的劇中造型，兩人在首兩集均有至少6至7個造型，分別配合角色浮誇鮮明的個性及經常轉換身分的設定。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:43.259889+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:44:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:58:10.616891+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.859938+00:00","content_hash":"680c1823a82652d925429614fc13106bc73485213ce4a9dff341d4a60f992d4f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}